DOMAIN-SUFFIX,log-yex.youdao.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,rlogs.youdao.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,log.yex.youdao.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,impservice.youdao.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,impservice2.youdao.com,REJECT
